The Licensor and its licensors retain all right, title, and interest in the
Software. This licence grants limited rights to use the Software and does not
sell or assign any ownership.

If You voluntarily provide feedback, You grant the Licensor a worldwide,
perpetual, irrevocable, royalty-free licence to use and incorporate that
feedback without restriction or obligation.

